uuid "2d71e57c-47ea-59aa-a1bb-3a529870bfbd")) (hierarchical_label "V3V3" (shape bidirectional) (at 25.4 359.41 180) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify right)) (uuid "51b70cd5-e45c-5d02-906e-e5e7ce74bdcd")) (label "V3V3" (at 40.64 359.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "86cd71b9-852d-5f0a-9214-4eebd023b082")) (hierarchical_label "VPD" (shape bidirectional) (at 114.30000000000001 359.41 180) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify right)) (uuid "f3bf7949-ec1e-54cd-b9eb-07e4177a6a12")) (label "VPD" (at 129.54000000000002 359.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6074db94-f41a-5e4e-912a-891f26094076")) (text "INTER-SHEET INTERFACE (see wired power-flow overview)" (at 20.32 318.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c69853fe-9ea9-5b01-939a-84d6565cbc12")) (text "J2 + J3: two parallel 16-pin outputs, pin 1 = -12V. C34-C36 at J2, C59-C61 at J3 (22u each, replace the 100u cans).\nD8 MAIN is the only status LED (rail LEDs removed): input-valid AND main-eFuse status AND RUN. Any bad rail after the\nstartup window or a U20 guard trip latches every rail off. Short OVLO-only pulses may recover. P12/P5/N12_OK: logic + test pads.\nU20 overvoltage guard (S8.1): +12V > 14.88 V, +5V > 5.83 V or -12V < -13.64 V nominal (corners 14.48-15.27 / 5.68-5.98 /\n13.27-14.02 V) pulls OV_N -> FAULT -> U5 off. Own reference REF_OV = U21 TLV431B (R100, C67, TP17); U18/U20 LM2901B;\nR93-R96, R98, R99 are 0.1 % / 25 ppm. The -12V channel compares MON_OVN with GND (no V3V3 term); D22 clamps MON_OVN\nat GND if V3V3 is lost while the rack holds -12V. D21 SMAJ5.0A is a transient clamp (6.4 V min breakdown), not an OV limit.\nS8.3: U18/U20 supplies are always-on VPD; outputs remain 3.3 V logic. U20 +5V guard monitors P5_RAW.\nU23 TPS259470A independently disconnects +5V at ~5.70 V (1.2 us typical, no maximum specified). D21 moved to P5_RAW.\nAUXOFF + FLT join P5_OK; faults latch after startup qualification. Severe raw OV is unmasked through U20.\nQ11/Q12/Q13/U22 crowbar removed. No guaranteed 6 V peak or prototype qualification is claimed." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "00beac9b-1c35-579b-95b8-b8b365ab7191")) (wire (pts (xy 25.4 339.09) (xy 40.64 339.09)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "a7f5250e-dd18-5b8c-b8e7-a9ef813ed71a")) (wire (pts (xy 25.4 349.25) (xy 40.64 349.25)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "51d2e51f-0f37-560d-9b8e-cbffe5eb958b")) (wire (pts (xy 25.4 359.41) (xy 40.64 359.41)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "4495f543-93c2-5eca-837a-6870a82669f1")) (wire (pts (xy 30.48 273.05) (xy 30.48 275.59)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "7af21e38-027c-5fde-8bdf-c4a80baa7a80")) (wire (pts (xy 30.48 283.21) (xy 30.48 285.75)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "f9563620-109d-5143-aa75-fa6a26b14cda")) (wire (pts (xy 30.48 285.75) (xy 40.64 285.75)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "e3e02a79-e763-54b1-8262-9c71a1ccef0a")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 146.05) (xy 35.56 148.59)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "f2e4b166-8a3a-5d00-804b-ec498ac16623")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 156.21) (xy 35.56 166.37)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "032c6c26-8953-5b20-94f2-ddb6e525ee59")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 173.99) (xy 35.56 176.53)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "5e284b4c-9889-5932-853f-76f315865ddf")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 241.3) (xy 40.64 241.3)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "8f48be7e-3a30-5e3e-bf72-9a94289438f6")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 243.84) (xy 38.1 243.84)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "d9aa2511-fd31-5ece-8e76-b1791bb7b4b6")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 251.46) (xy 40.64 251.46)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "a310daa8-6393-5d84-9c1c-e8c8f5781c61")) (wire (pts (xy 35.56 254.0) (xy 40.64 254.0)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "8db603cc-f37c-5885-bd3c-c11ceee6e86f")) (wire (pts (xy 38.1 243.84) (xy 38.1 246.38)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uu